The first train travels for 1 hour before the second train starts. In that time, it travels 60 km. The second train travels 90 km/h, so it will catch up to the first train in 60/90 = 2/3 hours. 2/3 hours is 40 minutes. So the second train will catch the first train at 4:40pm.
